# Conversion Architect

**Version**: 0.1.0  
**Authority**: GREEN (read-only advisory; no production mutations in WO-CA-0001)

Landing page design system and genome compiler. Transforms validated offers, claims, and economic outcomes into high-converting landing page genomes.

## Architecture

```
conversion-architect/
├── SKILL.md              # Skill definition
├── docs/                 # Documentation
├── schemas/             # Canonical domain models
├── agents/              # WD-01 to WD-06 designer roles
├── providers/           # Design pattern & Framer providers
├── design-system/       # Family signatures
├── skins/               # Vertical skin definitions
├── adapters/            # CallQuant adapter
├── genome_compiler.py   # Genome compilation
├── qa_system.py         # QA audit system
└── tests/               # Tests
```

## Canonical Domain

| Entity | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| `DesignFamily` | Collection of family signatures |
| `FamilySignature` | Grammar rules |
| `VerticalSkin` | Visual tokens per vertical |
| `LanderGenome` | Complete page specification |
| `QAAudit` | Quality assurance results |

## Agent Roles

| Role | Mission |
|------|---------|
| WD-01 | Visual Identity |
| WD-02 | Information Architecture |
| WD-03 | Conversion Layout |
| WD-04 | Proof Architecture |
| WD-05 | Mobile Experience |
| WD-06 | Motion Design |

## Providers

- **DesignPatternProvider**: Abstract for design patterns (MotionSites MCP)
- **FixtureProvider**: Fallback patterns for CI
- **FramerProvider**: Framer API integration

## Usage

```python
from conversion_architect.schemas import BusinessConversionContext
from conversion_architect.adapters import create_callquant_adapter
from conversion_architect.genome_compiler import compile_genome
from conversion_architect.qa_system import run_qa

# Build context from CallQuant
adapter = create_callquant_adapter()
context = adapter.build_context(
    campaign_cell=cell_data,
    intent_cluster=intent_data,
    offer_variant=offer_data,
    claim_manifest=claims_data
)

# Compile genome
genome = await compile_genome(context, family)

# QA audit
audit = await run_qa(genome)
if audit.can_proceed():
    # Proceed to preview
```

